			"notes": "Fast ImageFrames 1.7.2 for Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).\n\n**Overall: Better performance and new features.**\n\nAdded since B1.5.0:\n- Smooth maps seen at an angle or from far away (mipmaps), with a new slider in the settings.\n- Map previews in the inventory and tooltips, smoother and cheaper to draw.\n- Baked item frames are skipped by the entity render loop (entity pass about 20-37% faster with Iris).\n- Occlusion results are cached, no longer flushed on every light or section change.\n- Frames that do not change are checked less often.\n- Fixes: wall blinking when a frame loads into a baked section, ghost blocks with Sodium."
		},
